            "Episodes": {
                "1": {
                    "ID": "79792",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/corrector-yui/episodes/79792",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Let's Go To ComNet!",
                        "jpn": "コムネットへ出発！"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "A Computer Software named IR recruits Yui as a Corrector. He takes her inside a computer, where she sees her father's newest creation, \"\"Galaxy Land\"\". While at Galaxy Land, IR downloads \"\"The Element Suit\"\" which is found somewhere in Galaxy Land, Yui transforms. Grosser sends on of his cohorts out, War Wolf. Can Yui defeat Grosser? Why not pick up a copy of Corrector Yui: Volume 1?",
                        "jpn": ""
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "2": {
                    "ID": "79793",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/corrector-yui/episodes/79793",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Beware Of Nasty E-Mail",
                        "jpn": "悪口メールにご用心"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Yui finds out that IR wasn't a dream after all! She trys sending a message to her friends, but with the help of IR, she sends it by Comnet Mail. At school, Yui is asked a question she does not know, \"\"The Mouth Is The Gateway To Disaster\"\". Freaking out, Yui is forced to go to the Virtual Comnet World, with the command \"\"Corrector Yui Enter!\"\" While in the virutal world, Yui discovers that one of Grosser's Cohorts, Virus has infected the mailmen, and the messages that everyone sends is turned into something nasty. When Yui returns to the real world, she finally has the answer to the question, which she types in her computer. The answer is correct. After that, Yui and her friends go to Haruna's Birthday Party.",
                        "jpn": ""
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "3": {
                    "ID": "79794",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/corrector-yui/episodes/79794",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Take It Easy With The Food",
                        "jpn": "おいしいものはホドホドに"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Yui and IR suspect foul play when Chef Kirch, a family friend who can never get his recipes quite right. In the beginning if he mentions he has a new dish everyone wants to run for cover! Yui unable to turn down a friend tries it. Its actually good! He found a recipe on Comnet and a special seasoning has him with more customers than he can handle. Soon it gets out of hand and he has to face customers who've turned into ravenous zombies.",
                        "jpn": ""
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "4": {
                    "ID": "79795",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/corrector-yui/episodes/79795",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Trouble On The Fourtune Telling Net",
                        "jpn": "占いネットで恋の予感"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "A school-craze for fortune-telling develops into a destructive obsession. Who knew love advice could be so dangerous?",
                        "jpn": ""
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "5": {
                    "ID": "79796",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/corrector-yui/episodes/79796",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Listen To Nature's Song Part One",
                        "jpn": "とどけ！森の歌声 前編"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "A virtual-reality field trip into a nature park turns a day picking up litter into an all-out search for missing people. Can Corrector Yui save the day... and finish her homework?",
                        "jpn": ""
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "6": {
                    "ID": "79797",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/corrector-yui/episodes/79797",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Listen To Nature's Song Part Two",
                        "jpn": "とどけ！森の歌声 後編"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Yui and the other try to convince Eco that not all humans are bad. But at the same time Yui must also battle War Wolf. Who plans to burn the place to the ground! It turns out that Eco was the one who abducted all the people who littered in the nature park.",
                        "jpn": ""
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "7": {
                    "ID": "79798",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/corrector-yui/episodes/79798",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Big Trouble In D-Edo Net",
                        "jpn": "O-EDOネット大騒動"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Yui and her friends visit a virtual theme park. Here they can assume the roles of ancient Edo historical figures. Yui and the others must prevent Freeze, Jaggy and Virus from stealing a scroll that would allow them to become a \"\"Shogun\"\" and taking over!",
                        "jpn": ""
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "8": {
                    "ID": "79799",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/corrector-yui/episodes/79799",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Please Help Rescue",
                        "jpn": "レスキューをたすけて"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Yui finds a hurt blue bird and then goes to investigate Medical Net's malfunction. Freeze has a not to pleasant encounter Rescue another Corrector program. Later Yui has a run-in with Freeze who destroys her com con. Then a strange man appears can he fix her con com? And will Freeze survive her next encounter with Rescue?",
                        "jpn": ""
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
